    "title": "North Bergen defeats Bayonne - Boys soccer recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Craig Epstein ,\n1 hours ago Franchesco Cardona scored the go-ahead goal for North Bergen from 28 yards out with three seconds remaining to give it a 3-2 win against Bayonne in Bayonne. Mohammed Ali opened the scoring for Bayonne (1-6-2) before North Bergen (2-6-2) took a 2-1 lead at halftime with goals from Marvin Rosales. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
